data: {"id": "16940a5032b141a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-351", "run_id": "16940a5032b141a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已从上一轮获取了关键事实，现在需要确认 readinessProbe 配置并检查应用层日志中的具体依赖错误。\n\n**本轮计划：**\n1. `kubectl_get_yaml` - 获取 Pod YAML 以确认 readinessProbe 的具体配置（endpoint, timeout 等）。\n2. `kubectl_logs_grep` - 在日志中搜索 \"dependency\" 或 \"error\" 以明确是哪个下游服务不可用。\n\n首先获取 YAML 和日志关键字搜索：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788465742306, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

