data: {"id": "16940a5032b141a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-861", "run_id": "16940a5032b141a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有必需的证据已采集完毕，证据之间没有冲突，能够完整回答本轮问题。\n\n### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 生命周期**：`workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` (namespace `aiops-case-09`) 自 2026-09-03 17:53:37Z 启动，节点 `node2`，已运行 128 分钟。\n2. **当前状态**：\n   - Phase: `Running` (容器进程未崩溃)。\n   - READY: `0/1`，状态 `Running`，无重启 (`restarts=0`)。\n   - Conditions: `Initialized=True`, `PodScheduled=True`，但 `Ready=False`、`ContainersReady=False`，原因是 `ContainersNotReady`。\n3. **事件 (Events)**：持续产生 `Warning Unhealthy` 事件 (128 分钟内 2598 次)，原因为 `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed wit", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788465775589, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

